            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148766,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ajoute un deuxième paramètre, <code>enemyCount</code>, à la fonction fléchée.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" getTotalLoot = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"coins, enemyCount\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" coins * enemyCount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(getTotalLoot(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"));\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assurez-vous de choisir <code>,</code> suivi de <code>enemyCount</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
